{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "de0aae4d5945c062864e2f622436b1d42c339cb775e40ce87e5683ef83f88fe2", "ja": "（今話題のオムニバスドラマ番組。その挿入歌\n候補として、劇場のアイドル達の曲が選ばれた！）", "zh": "（最近正热门的单元剧节目。剧场偶像们的歌曲被选作插曲候选曲了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0c6097babd480b21ec88e6f13d9c0a8c7857d3c5d5157fab7bbda3c1973d870a", "ja": "（今回のテーマは『切ない恋愛』……候補になっている\nのはエレナの新曲、恵美、それから千鶴さんのソロだ）", "zh": "（这次的主题是『悲伤的恋爱』……候选曲有艾蕾娜的新歌、惠美的歌，还有千鹤小姐的独唱曲）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "3f661c262d4fd8ce2cbebf299464a3d40fa2ee027236e47be5acff6b6512542e", "ja": "新曲のダンスは、もうマスターしたんだヨー。\n今は、歌詞を覚えてるところ！", "zh": "新歌的舞蹈，我已经学会了哟——\n现在正在记歌词！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "dd1851f59d6d4343dd7c1cc9359e731c308ce3bd609dd1b803964d4d17b5b012", "ja": "すっげー！　エレナ、新曲もらったばっかなんだろ？\n気合い入ってんなー。", "zh": "太厉害了！艾蕾娜，你才刚拿到新歌吧？干劲十足嘛——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1004_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1005_p", "source_sha256": "61a47f2b196926f5234de95af845e92367d528ce8a8ce493d0ddf40adcc72dc6", "ja": "おっ、みんな揃ってるな。お疲れさま！", "zh": "哦，大家都到齐了啊。辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "05e29e0a4284f2be44775c77440fb613bcacc345a6ffb6da432c065ef129ff15", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nヒビキ、チヅルもお疲れさまだヨ～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n响、千鹤，你们也辛苦啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1007_020meg", "source_sha256": "398fb1a0dd1cd8336ec8b244c59c9484e937277e4ac8c0a71e04ad9b88564350", "ja": "ねえ{$P$}、アタシたちの\nソロ曲がドラマで使われるかもって、どういうコト？", "zh": "喂，{$P$}，你说我们的个人曲可能会在电视剧里使用，是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6b958daf51208facad5a55f10a3b8eadb559f6364dcfe5a832f43b33008e8d73", "ja": "お、もう聞いたのか。\nそれを説明しようと思ってたんだ。", "zh": "哦，你已经听说了啊。\n我正打算跟你说明这件事呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e2386bf859d6f2bbff6f317fe2338412a79ea2410f6073d4d3d71c8984d96573", "ja": "みんなもタイトルは知ってるんじゃないかな？\nネット配信番組の『ドラマMILLION』……。", "zh": "大家应该也听说过名字吧？\n就是网络播出节目《Drama MILLION》……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "5197f494ba2171cb0632f185f91f1fc3465588688c629d2aed0dbddddda7d5ea", "ja": "自分、知ってるぞ！　いろんなジャンルの、\n短いドラマを放送してる番組だよね？", "zh": "我知道哦！就是那个播放各种类型短剧的网络节目，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d682e7dc752522eb920b9852a0df5336858c5462ae12c37bab3688bc9a12fa9c", "ja": "ああ。今回はその恋愛ドラマの挿入歌候補として、\nエレナと恵美、千鶴さんや皆の曲が挙がってるんだ。", "zh": "嗯。这次作为那部恋爱剧的插曲候选，提到了艾蕾娜、惠美、千鹤小姐，还有大家的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5b625bec5aa75f0113a645a3144262fdbaf22c3192ee87237d8cf1bb5c88d53f", "ja": "今回はAutumn編……\nテーマは、『切ない恋愛』だそうだ。", "zh": "这次是Autumn篇……\n听说主题是“苦涩的恋爱”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "4fa171aa15b97b43f7257b2540ee577971d5e0c92f6d5de8399fccca52bfc0b2", "ja": "オータム……秋ですわね。\n確かにどことなく、切なさを感じる季節ですわ……。", "zh": "Autumn……就是秋天呢。\n确实是个不知为何让人感到伤感的季节……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "ddbf9a8dfebeeb39389cfbdda4f22ec99d11320924888a64424c9e6da4244d83", "ja": "自分は、夏の終わりのほうが切なくなるかな。\n夕方、三線の音が聞こえてきたりするんだよね。", "zh": "我觉得夏天快结束的时候更容易感到伤感呢。傍晚听到三线琴的声音什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "6134de62102d1b9c9eb3c935ca08972c7b9c25e580247c6b08866a1fd58d038d", "ja": "オレも響と同じかな～。夏休みの宿題が終わんなくて\nバタバタしてる時とか、すっげー悲しくなるもん！", "zh": "我也和响差不多吧～。像暑假作业做不完、手忙脚乱的时候，就会觉得特别难过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d3458fcca2993396f817e70c72d0ede2d9a5bcebcb699d0d7345c296ab937757", "ja": "いや、その悲しさは何か違うような……ともかく、\nドラマに採用されれば、注目度アップは間違いなしだ！", "zh": "不，那种悲伤好像不太一样……总之，只要能被电视剧采用，关注度肯定会大幅提升！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1017_p", "source_sha256": "764fc959107a7c480a38e6a39274b261713853bfa968e5980a2394a5a18389cd", "ja": "みんな、しっかり準備していこうな。", "zh": "大家，好好做好准备吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "58be5c60919ba3388603b70c139c953ed7e1667ef4b63b0fa216cbb5b880f23c", "ja": "ハーイ！　……準備って、曲を覚える以外に\nどんなコトしたらいいのかナ？", "zh": "嗨！……除了记住歌曲以外，还要做些什么准备呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "2c4cbded7b8a0953c242455dc9465442bcb2efeb1bc7da08e733071c9fd51e19", "ja": "やっぱ恋の曲だから、恋の勉強じゃないか？\nオレもユニット組んだとき、ちょっとだけ勉強したぜ！", "zh": "既然是恋爱题材的歌，那应该就是学学恋爱了吧？\n我之前组组合的时候，也稍微学了一点呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "b2f1f20ee75b822d4b59f25b2fd45c5eac34a923c43d33361ca807c5c08dfd9a", "ja": "えっ、勉強したの？\nでも、アイドルは恋しちゃダメじゃないか？", "zh": "咦，你还学习过恋爱？可是，偶像不是不能谈恋爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1021_038chz", "source_sha256": "83995c77734829d3f621c3b9345bbd619c3a721ce1a262ea2848d1b85c7c4c2b", "ja": "『恋を知る』必要はあるのに、『恋愛はNG』\nというのは、なんとも矛盾していますわよね……。", "zh": "明明有必要“了解恋爱”，却又“禁止谈恋爱”，实在是很矛盾呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "834f73f1673a89533c978870458e9fc49451dacbd4aa19a86ade12717a27b0e4", "ja": "けど、実際に恋愛をせずとも、\n映画やドラマなどから得られるものもあるはず……。", "zh": "不过，即使不实际谈恋爱，\n也应该能从电影、电视剧之类的作品中有所收获……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "0feac22d60929069e457b40481b510b6a46581e29f8587a5a59cce654f493719", "ja": "そっか～。ワタシ、がんばってみる！\nとってもステキな曲だから、選んでもらいたいし！", "zh": "这样啊～我会努力试试的！\n因为是首特别棒的歌，我也想让它被选上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1024_018ele", "source_sha256": "97af9ebbda312f4d62a2ee9411c6d13fd0be63f536b73fdbc18d97ac82f9b9ec", "ja": "メグミ、チヅル！　ふたりとはライバルだけど、\nワタシ、負けないからネ～？　エヘヘ♪", "zh": "惠美、千鹤！虽然我们是竞争对手，\n但我可不会输给你们哦～？嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "653b88fe579e7d7c3b420d50cae5b54221072225ed5fb51e702aa2a689836a2b", "ja": "ええ、もちろんですわ！\nエレナ、恵美、正々堂々と勝負ですわよ！", "zh": "嗯，当然啦！\n艾蕾娜、惠美，我们堂堂正正地一决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_094_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "9bbfc806dbb52f8b1fb25863e5aceceac7ff26e6f3b73feda183a694091ba428", "ja": "え！？　あ、うん。そだね……！", "zh": "诶！？啊，嗯。是啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
